  "configuration_id": "config_031",
  "reason": "Evidence: scvi_n200 is clearly the dominant RNA encoder (0.725 vs 0.520 for scgpt), and within scvi_n200 + imagenet_vit_l + multiprofile, transformer+weighted is the best combo (0.725). However, the image encoder dimension (resnet50 vs imagenet_vit_l) remains completely untested with scvi_n200. This experiment tests whether resnet50 can match or exceed imagenet_vit_l while keeping the best aggregation (transformer) and fusion (weighted) from config_007. It is the best use of this slot because it probes the largest unexplored architectural axis; if resnet50 is competitive, it opens alternative paths for the remaining 4 experiments, and if it underperforms, we can confidently lock in imagenet_vit_l and focus remaining budget on fine-grained fusion/aggregation or profile-setting variations."
}

